# Notification Settings
# Get your webhook ID from n8n (the UUID in the webhook URL)
# Example: if webhook is http://localhost:5678/webhook/977281dd-6d27-4c67-a734-e78513b6935e
# then use: N8N_WEBHOOK_ID=977281dd-6d27-4c67-a734-e78513b6935e
N8N_WEBHOOK_ID=977281dd-6d27-4c67-a734-e78513b6935e
